[[File:Freyshear Keep.png|thumb|right|300px]]
'''Freyshear Keep''' is a keep located on an island overlooking the [[Baradin Bay]] in [[Gilneas]]. In addition to its position over the sea, it holds a vantage point over the town of [[Ravenshire]], its cannons being a constant threat to the [[Ravenwood Rebellion]] and denying it incoming shipments of supplies for the rebellion,<ref>{{Alliance}} [42] [[Assaulting Freyshear Keep]]</ref> as well as threatening Horde transport ships trading with the Undercity.<ref>{{Horde}} [42] [[Guns of Gilneas]]</ref>

